     1	# Fresh real loss streams (SOTA sprint, final external validation)
     2	
     3	Built by `uv run python scripts/sota_sprint/fresh_real.py` (sklearn 1.9.1, numpy 2.5.4,
     4	pandas 3.0.6; repo HEAD at build time e664e52). Raw zips live under `data/raw/sprint_fresh/`
     5	(gitignored). Protocol: `docs/sota_sprint/fresh_real_protocol.md`.
     6	
     7	Each `<dataset>.npz` holds `l0`, `l1` (int8, shape `(K, 2000)`; incumbent and challenger 0-1
     8	losses) and `starts` (int64, absolute row index of each episode in the chronologically sorted,
     9	cleaned table). `stats.json` holds the full build record (descriptive only).
    10	
    11	`npz_sha256` is the file hash. `np.savez` stamps zip entry times, so a rebuild changes it;
    12	`array_content_sha256` = sha256(l0.tobytes() + l1.tobytes() + starts.tobytes()) is the
    13	reproducible check.
